  "acceptance": "This record covers the CPU timing control. The supplied app-local DXVK game binaries remain the physically accepted game configuration. The change has not been accepted for live gameplay.",
  "observed_tradeoff": {
    "comparisons": 12,
    "lower_thread_cpu_share": 12,
    "larger_p95_absolute_period_error": 8,
    "decision": "Retain the existing game limiter. The bounded-spin candidate reduced measured thread CPU in every setting, but several timing tails worsened. On ARM64EC at 8 Hz, P95 absolute period error increased from 3.7164 ms to 90.2586 ms across the two short runs.",
    "accounting": "GetThreadTimes has finite accounting granularity. One x64 group reported zero charged time despite nonzero thread-cycle counts. No system-wide CPU or power saving is inferred."
  }
